#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-thrust-scaling.rst:5
#: e70cf26067c74c4fa0a1a4f394023256
msgid "Motor Thrust Scaling"
msgstr "电机推力缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-thrust-scaling.rst:7
#: 1e4d83df90504006aa02f10de80b9af3
msgid ""
"Rover includes motor thrust scaling which may improve steering and speed "
"control slightly by compensating for the non-linear output of the ESCs and "
"motors."
msgstr "Rover 包含电机推力缩放功能，可通过补偿 ESC 和电机的非线性输出，略微改善转向和速度控制效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-thrust-scaling.rst:9
#: e9e39950bdcb49c6809428e1c393b1fa
msgid ""
"By default this scaling is disabled (i.e. no compensation) which works well "
"enough for most vehicles but to improve performance you may wish to measure "
"the wheels RPM given various throttle levels and then adjust the "
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` parameter to linearise the response."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下此缩放功能已禁用（即不进行补偿），对大多数车辆而言已足够，但若要提升性能，可在不同油门下测量车轮转速，然后调整 "
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` 参数以线性化响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-thrust-scaling.rst:14
#: 10572e7ada2747d591e72ddd27398739
msgid ""
"Above shows the curve for a few different values of :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO "
"<MOT_THST_EXPO>`.  Many Rovers use DC motors which generally work best with "
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` values between 0 and -0.5."
msgstr ""
"上图展示了几个不同 :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` 值对应的曲线。许多 Rover 使用直流电机，通常 "
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO <MOT_THST_EXPO>` 值在 0 到 -0.5 之间效果最佳。"
